Z||000001||fierosound||07-10-2000||11:38 PM||||More 3.4L projects you can follow below.  Whitehorse has a bodykit and builds performance engines.<P>Project Windstorm - 2.8 to 3.4L conversion (1987 GMC S-15 pickup)  <BR><A HREF="http://www.s-series.org/htm/windstorm/project-windstorm-stage3.htm" TARGET=_blank> &lt;A HREF="http://www.s-series.org/htm/windstorm/project-windstorm-stage3.htm</A>" <P>Freddy's 3.4L buildup  <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/on/freddysplace/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/on/freddysplace/</A> <P>Whitehorse builds V6 engines 150-300hp (Scorpion SS kitcar  <A HREF="http://www.kitcar.com/whitehorse/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kitcar.com/whitehorse/</A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 07-10-2000).]||||reg||14
